1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,428
Good evening, excellence.

2
00:00:01,576 --> 00:00:03,006
Last episode’s riddle?

3
00:00:03,006 --> 00:00:04,867
The answer: RADAR.

4
00:00:04,987 --> 00:00:05,955
A word that reads

5
00:00:05,955 --> 00:00:06,922
the same both ways…

6
00:00:06,922 --> 00:00:08,529
and it separates what merely

7
00:00:08,529 --> 00:00:10,137
exists from what is excellent.

8
00:00:10,137 --> 00:00:11,731
Two factories have the

9
00:00:11,731 --> 00:00:13,325
same preventive maintenance procedure.

10
00:00:13,352 --> 00:00:14,646
The auditor asked the first:

11
00:00:14,646 --> 00:00:15,941
do you have a procedure?

12
00:00:15,941 --> 00:00:17,021
They said: yes, here it

13
00:00:17,021 --> 00:00:17,885
