19
00:00:26,371 --> 00:00:28,017
Both have a procedure…

20
00:00:28,025 --> 00:00:30,185
but which one is truly excellent?

21
00:00:30,221 --> 00:00:32,286
RADAR works like a GPS.

22
00:00:32,286 --> 00:00:34,539
You set your destination, choose the route,

23
00:00:34,539 --> 00:00:36,829
actually drive, and if you go wrong…

24
00:00:36,829 --> 00:00:37,933
