25
00:00:37,969 --> 00:00:40,352
Results, Approach, Deployment,

26
00:00:40,352 --> 00:00:42,268
Assessment, and Refinement.

27
00:00:42,268 --> 00:00:44,180
And that procedure in the file… is

28
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,819
just one of the five letters.

29
00:00:45,819 --> 00:00:48,037
The first factory has a written

30
00:00:48,037 --> 00:00:49,885
method: no goal, no measurement.

31
00:00:49,885 --> 00:00:51,399
The second closed the loop:

32
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:52,717
it knows what it wants

33
00:00:52,717 --> 00:00:53,772
to achieve, it deployed,

34
00:00:53,772 --> 00:00:55,437
measured, and improved.

35
00:00:55,483 --> 00:00:56,399
Try it tomorrow:

36
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:57,936
pick one practice you have,

37
00:00:57,936 --> 00:00:59,165
